      <title>dma_buf buffer sharing</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>X.org+OpenICC Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk covers the desing of dma_buf as merged into Linux Kernel 3.3 and deep-dives into some of the technical issues that make buffer sharing&#xA;non-trivial. It will also explore what&amp;#39;s definitely still missing and look at what crazy stuff still might come to dma_buf in future.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
